Package: com.theoccurrence.appbuilder
Name: AppBuilder
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Injects a selectable set of tweaks into a decrypted iOS app and repacks it as an IPA
Maintainer: arichornlover
Author: qnblackcat
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)

